    "reviews": "\u201cIf you want to play a game that feels like every weird Adult Swim animated show thrown together into a blender, then you should check out 1000 Deaths.\u201d<br>Kotaku<br><br>\u201cFor fans of hardcore \u2018die-and-try\u2019 games with a mindset like \u2018Death is the essence of action games,\u2019 1000 Deaths is definitely worth keeping an eye on.\u201d<br>Famitsu<br><br>\u201c1000 Deaths\u00a0is a &quot;gravity-bending 3D\u00a0platformer\u00a0where your choices matter&quot;, and also a game that looks like graphics card box art from the '90s and 2000s. To be clear, this is the highest of compliments I can hand out.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br>",
